  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside King Quan Inheritance it looks like a jade stone, only thumb-size. The exterior of the jade stone looks like a dog head. Fang Yuan activates it with one drop of light golden primeval essence. It turns into a jade light, bursts from solid to hollow, and flies into a wild dog. The Gu goes into the dog’s soul and does not damage the physical body. The dog then obeys. King Quan modified the blessed land so a Gu Master may bring in a rank one copy, while other Gu worms cannot be used there except Spring Autumn Cicada.",
        "chapters": [
          346
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
