    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "A Gu Master who wants to enter King Quan inheritance must refine a rank one copy. After the entry method spreads through Shang clan city, buyers find this Gu priced about three times as before. Talk in that rush says King Quan has at least three rank five copies, and that with them one can enslave myriad beast kings and command an army.",
        "chapters": [
          324
        ],
