  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Before news of the three kings inheritance was released, Fang Yuan had been buying the three types in secret and had not gone all in, from a vigilant nature.",
        "chapters": [
          323
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "From the tenth round the surroundings fill with dense grey fog. Apart from Spring Autumn Cicada, none of Fang Yuan’s other Gu can be used. Nineteen dogs walk around him with only a faint connection left from this Gu, and that control strengthens as the fog thins. Han Bu Liu, an enslavement path Gu Master, tells himself that in this round they can only use dog enslavement Gu, that Fang Yuan walks the strength path, and that a youth that young could not have proficiency in the enslavement path.",
        "chapters": [
          347
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fog-and-control",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_han_bu_liu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Heavenly power brings another fog. Fang Yuan takes the chrysanthemum akita path. When that fog disappears he receives twenty rank one copies. The Gu is hard to retrieve: they are planted into the dog’s soul, and when the dog dies the soul dissipates and the Gu dies with it. Blessed land power takes away extra copies in a Gu Master’s hands and leaves only one.",
        "chapters": [
          348
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "chrysanthemum-akita-path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_blessed_lands_and_grotto_heavens"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After the fog disperses, a rank two copy falls from the sky into Fang Yuan’s palm. Using a rank one copy on ordinary dogs is easy to do half-heartedly. Subduing a hundred beast king with a rank two copy can fail, and if that copy is destroyed he is finished. Under his supervision it flies into the big lightning symbol dog and plants itself into its soul. A formless mental impact assaults him through the Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          349
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "lightning-symbol-round",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A rank two copy falls from above as his prize for winning a later round.",
        "chapters": [
          351
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "winning-round-prize",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "After Fang Yuan tells Bai Ning Bing the refinement plan, he gives her a dog enslavement Gu and disappears. The land spirit sends her to the first round of King Quan Inheritance.",
        "chapters": [
          381
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "partner-copy",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
